      "name": "F.A.T.E. Preview Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "play-fate",
      "description": "Solid amber user-initiated hero preview action; text changes with playback state.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-play-fate\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"/></svg><span>Play preview</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-play-fate{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;min-width:10.5rem;gap:0.75rem;padding:0.75rem 1.125rem;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:2px;background:#edb632;color:#14130f;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:650;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms}.ds-play-fate:hover{background:#eef0f1;color:#101316}.ds-play-fate:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #eef0f1;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-play-fate{width:100%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-play-fate{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Buried In Ruin Preview Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "play-ruin",
      "description": "Scarlet variant of the same hero playback control.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-play-ruin\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"/></svg><span>Play preview</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-play-ruin{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;min-width:10.5rem;gap:0.75rem;padding:0.75rem 1.125rem;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:2px;background:#b62430;color:#fff5f1;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans),sans-serif;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:650;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms}.ds-play-ruin:hover{background:#f1ece4;color:#120e0e}.ds-play-ruin:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #f1ece4;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-play-ruin{width:100%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-play-ruin{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Hero Seek and Timing",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "hero-seek",
      "description": "Native seek input with a thin visual track and 44px target; shown in the F.A.T.E. palette. The preview is a static visual sample, not an audio player.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-timeline\"><input class=\"ds-seek\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"34\" aria-label=\"Seek preview\"/><span class=\"ds-time\">0:34 / 1:40</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-timeline{display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:0;gap:1rem;background:#101316;color:#eef0f1}.ds-seek{appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;flex:1;min-width:0;height:44px;margin:0;border-radius:2px;background:transparent;color:#edb632;cursor:pointer}.ds-seek:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #eef0f1;outline-offset:5px}.ds-seek:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:0.55}.ds-seek::-webkit-slider-runnable-track{height:3px;background:linear-gradient(to right,#edb632 0% 34%,#383e43 34% 100%)}.ds-seek::-moz-range-track{height:3px;background:linear-gradient(to right,#edb632 0% 34%,#383e43 34% 100%)}.ds-seek::-webkit-slider-thumb{appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;width:9px;height:15px;margin-top:-6px;border:0;border-radius:1px;background:#eef0f1}.ds-seek::-moz-range-thumb{width:9px;height:15px;border:0;border-radius:1px;background:#eef0f1}.ds-time{flex-shrink:0;color:#b9c0c5;font-family:var(--font-geist-mono),monospace;font-size:0.7rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;min-width:9.5ch;text-align:right}"
    },
